OL,3,GNEWSAParents protest outside school
OL,4,Afollowing 'shock' kitchen closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have been protesting outside a
OL,7,Fschool after the Education Authority
OL,8,F(EA) made the decision to close its
OL,9,Fkitchen.
OL,11,FSchool dinners for pupils at St
OL,12,FJoseph's Primary School in Donagh in
OL,13,FCounty Fermanagh are now being prepared
OL,14,Fat a school eight miles away in
OL,15,FMaguiresbridge and being delivered each
OL,16,Fday by taxi.
OL,18,FThe school's principal, Michael Grew,
OL,19,Fcalled the move "disappointing" and
OL,20,Fsaid he hopes the decision can "be
OL,21,Freversed or looked at again for the
OL,22,Fgood of the community".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
