OL,3,GNEWSAParents protest outside school
OL,4,Afollowing 'shock' kitchen closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe EA said that they are facing
OL,7,F"unprecedented budgetary pressures" and
OL,8,Fhave a "responsibility to identify all
OL,9,Fpotential savings options, including
OL,10,Famalgamation of school kitchens where
OL,11,Ffeasible."
